OL,3,ANHS, schools and police forces hit by
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft said services were now
OL,7,Fgradually being restored globally after
OL,8,Fa problem caused by a higher-than-usual
OL,9,Fstress on its servers, but users could
OL,10,Fstill experience disruption.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/37
