OL,3,AFormer Hamas bodyguard guilty of UK
OL,4,Aknife attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Hamas bodyguard, wanted in
OL,7,FGermany over an alleged plot to murder
OL,8,FJewish people, has been found guilty of
OL,9,Fa knife attack on a bailiff outside his
OL,10,FUK home.
OL,12,FMohammed Alfatih, previously known as
OL,13,FMohammed Naim, was regularly seen
OL,14,Facting as a bodyguard for a former
OL,15,Fleader of Hamas in 2006. He was granted
OL,16,Fasylum in the UK in 2015 and British
OL,17,Fcitizenship in 2020.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/37
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
