OL,3,ABessent blames Lutnick's Commerce
OL,4,ADepartment for failing to block
OL,5,AMegaspeed
OL,6,
OL,7,FMegaspeed had been probed by US
OL,8,Fgovernment agencies over suspicions it
OL,9,Fhad been smuggling chips into China,
OL,10,Freports said, but it is not on a list
OL,11,Fof firms that US companies are
OL,12,Fprevented from working with.
OL,14,FBessent told CNBC several agencies
OL,15,F"were in favour of putting Megaspeed on
OL,16,Fthe entity list for months".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/37
